'''Street Bazaar''' (さおだけ屋台, ''Sao Dake Yatai'', '''Street Stand''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.5 Update|Version 10.5]].

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

